JSON is valid. Here's a summary of the extraction:

- **RCI-1 (MSAD)**: **Yes** — 100+ primary studies, 298 study-site combinations
- **RCI-2 (EPD)**: **Yes** — 13 EPDs used in the reference cohort
- **RCI-3 (EPD names)**: HCP; ABIDE; Cam-CAN; UK Biobank; OASIS; ADNI; PNC; ABCD; IXI; NKI; HBN; COBRE; AIBL
- **RCI-4 (Phase)**: **Overall** — no explicit train/test split; all controls used for GAMLSS fitting
- **RCI-5 (N)**: 7 global models with N ranging from 59,599 (CT) to 77,157 (GMV)
- **RCI-6 (Sex)**: ~50-51% female across all models, computed from supplementary tables
- **RCI-7 (Age)**: Weighted mean ~41 years; range from 0.31y (115 days post-conception) to 99.94y; SD not available per study group


